OL,3,GNEWSAParents upset after plans for new
OL,4,Aschool cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a second primary school on a
OL,7,FRotherham estate have been formally
OL,8,Fshelved despite dozens of children
OL,9,Fbeing refused places at the existing
OL,10,Fschool.
OL,12,FWhen the original outline planning
OL,13,Fapplication for the Waverley estate was
OL,14,Fgranted in 2011 it included proposals
OL,15,Ffor 3,890 homes and two new primary
OL,16,Fschools.
OL,18,FHowever, Rotherham Council has now
OL,19,Fremoved the second school from the
OL,20,Fdevelopment agreement as fewer homes
OL,21,Fhave been built than expected.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
