OL,3,GNEWSAParents upset after plans for new
OL,4,Aschool cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move has prompted objections from
OL,7,F83 parents and a local councillor who
OL,8,Fsaid the existing primary school was
OL,9,Falready oversubscribed.
